  "prefLabel": "Ins 2604.16 Soliciting Names of Prospective Insureds",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 2604.16 Soliciting Names of Prospective Insureds. Any advertisement which the insurer uses to solicit leads for prospective applicants shall disclose that an agent for the insurer will contact the applicant if such is the fact.\n\nSource. #9333, eff 12-5-08; ss by #11173, eff 12-5-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins2600.html"
